  'Software developer who spends weekends braaiing with friends and hiking Table Mountain. Looking for someone to share good coffee and deep conversations with.', ARRAY['Hiking','Coffee','Deep talks','Music','Adventure']::text[], 'South Africa', 'Cape Town',
